Subject: Cantor Semantic Inspection Stdio Host P0 Requirement Matrix

@ [matrix_uuid] 861936d9-f371-4ebc-8734-71b4ef76fae7
@ [specification_uuid] 4ee53d21-ed53-4f35-bbaf-06cab3a34085

& [CustodyAndIdentity]
  + CSIH-001 CSIH-002 CSIH-003 are supported by source custody manifest binary metadata and exact invocation tests

& [Admission]
  + CSIH-004 through CSIH-006 are supported by bounded-reader unit tests overflow empty read-fault and dispatch-counter adversaries

& [DispatchAndResponse]
  + CSIH-007 through CSIH-010 are supported by direct-versus-process response equality constructive pages pagination and nested-refusal tests

& [FaultAndPublication]
  + CSIH-011 through CSIH-016 are supported by fixed-fault exit mutual-exclusion partial-output and byte-bound tests

& [DeterminismAndAbsence]
  + CSIH-017 through CSIH-019 are supported by fresh-process replay effect accounts dependency audit and static source absence

& [Closure]
  + CSIH-020 through CSIH-024 are supported by dual-profile adversarial workspace evidence attribution completion signature publication and bookend gates

& [Acceptance]
  + CSIH-A01 through CSIH-A05 require constructive process correspondence atomic fault truth effect-surface closure complete gates and exact publication lineage

& [Unsupported]
  + no requirement supports paths filesystem sockets services sessions MCP LSP environment shell provider model child process update remote merge or non-stdio product effects
